{"about_the_game":"Rocking Legend is a musical game where you'll take the part of a virtual rock star immersed in beautiful and dynamic environments.<br><br>Choose between <strong>guitar</strong> or <strong>drums</strong> and immediately go on stage in <strong>free-play</strong> mode. Alternatively, you can participate in the single-player <strong>campaign</strong> through a series of levels and original soundtracks created purposely for the game to improve your skills and unlock <strong>new instrument skins</strong>. If you don't want to play alone, you can even play in <strong>multiplayer</strong> PvP or cooperatively in a band of two!<br><br>Compete on the global <strong>leaderboards</strong> using your preferred control scheme and a selection of <strong>gameplay modifiers</strong>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Guitar modes:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Finger-tracked</strong> (only index controllers at the moment)<br></li><li> <strong>Hand-tracked</strong> with two sub-modes: Classic or Advanced<br></li><li> <strong>PC Keyboard / Game controllers support</strong></li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1260800/extras/3360ab770d066c014a7fb49ff482c942.poster.avif?t=1758477928\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1260800/extras/3360ab770d066c014a7fb49ff482c942.webm?t=1758477928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1260800/extras/3360ab770d066c014a7fb49ff482c942.mp4?t=1758477928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1260800/extras/45353e6938cabeb3557f09913e7e9e02.poster.avif?t=1758477928\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https: